      "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the game</h2>Larry's Mixology Lab is a single-player visual novel driven by dialogue and choices. Play as Larry, a bar owner, and meet characters at a securities firm, a university, city streets, and Green Island. Your choices can affect character relationships, story branches, and endings.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Multiple character routes and endings</strong>: Read conversations, make choices, and try different story branches.<br></li><li><strong>40 local save slots</strong>: Keep separate progress for different routes, with quick save and quick load also available.<br></li><li><strong>Ending collection</strong>: Reached endings are recorded automatically so you can check your progress across routes.<br></li><li><strong>Mouse and keyboard controls</strong>: Click the dialogue box or press Enter or Space to advance the story. Press F11 to toggle fullscreen.<br></li><li><strong>8 languages</strong>: Traditional Chinese, English, Japanese, Korean, Simplified Chinese, Thai, German and Spanish. Switch the interface and story language from the title screen. There is no character voice acting.</li></ul>",
